<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fernz to release yr results on July 30.</title>
<headline>Fernz to release yr results on July 30.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals group Fernz Corporation said on Wednesday it would be announcing its results for the year ended May 31 in a week's time on July 30.</p>
<p>The company's earnings profile is strongly skewed towards the second half and in February it said that it expected strong cash flow and two-thirds of its budgeted annual profit to be generated in the period.</p>
<p>Last October the company predicted its annual profit would be about NZ$47.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
